# Proprietary third-party runtime (not redistributable)
# ByteDance/Qishui web security runtime and the Qishui audio decryptor remain the
# property of their respective rights holders (declared in NOTICE.md), so they are
# excluded from this public repository. They stay on local disk and are still packed
# into local builds (see the "files" list in package.json); a fresh clone must supply
# them separately to use Qishui login / audio decryption.
qishui-auth-v6/
qishui-audio-decryptor/

# Assistant / IDE working state (local only)
# WorkBuddy memory logs and Trae working documents are private working notes and
# internal analysis, not product source. Keep them out of the public repository.
.workbuddy/
.trae/

